OL,3,GNEWSAWoman's warning to prevent attacks
OL,4,Aon new students
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,7,Fwhich some readers may find
OL,8,Fdistressing.
OL,10,FNew students are being urged to be
OL,11,Fcautious of people they meet on a night
OL,12,Fout by a woman who said her experience
OL,13,Fof being raped during freshers week
OL,14,Fleft her feeling "traumatised".
OL,16,FFlorence said she met a man who was
OL,17,Fposing as a student at a party as she
OL,18,Fbegan her third year at Newcastle
OL,19,FUniversity, after leaving the party she
OL,20,Fsaid she went to his house where he
OL,21,Fraped her.
