OL,3,GNEWSAWoman's warning to prevent attacks
OL,4,Aon new students
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "My eyes have been opened to
OL,7,Fthe evil that people plan during this
OL,8,Ftime, they take advantage of people and
OL,9,Fthe fact that people don't know anyone
OL,10,Fvery well or even know a city well,
OL,11,Fit's calculated."
